00:56:06,666 --> 00:56:12,666
Drumline: A New Beat is a 2014 American television
film directed by Bille Woodruff.

11
01:01:43,333 --> 01:01:49,333
It is the sequel to 2002's Drumline.

12
01:07:20,000 --> 01:07:26,000
The screenplay, a fictional story about a historically black college
marching band, was written by Karen Gist and Regina Hicks.

13
01:12:56,666 --> 01:13:02,666
The story is about a young drummer from New York, played by Alexandra Shipp, who enters the fictional
Atlanta A&T University and bumps heads with the leader of her new school's drum section.

14
01:18:33,333 --> 01:18:39,333
Jordan Calloway, Mario Van Peebles, and LeToya Luckett co-star.

15
01:24:10,000 --> 01:24:16,000
Leonard Roberts reprises his role as Sean Taylor, while Nick
Cannon was the film's executive producer.

16
01:29:46,666 --> 01:29:52,666
The film premiered on VH1 on October 21, 2014, and
released to DVD on March 3, 2015.

17
01:35:23,333 --> 01:35:29,333
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
